# Shady OBJ renderer smoke test: an elevated wedge near the origin.
v -0.75 -0.62 -1.60
v  0.75 -0.62 -1.60
v  0.75 -0.62 -0.40
v -0.75 -0.62 -0.40
v -0.75  0.10 -1.60
v  0.75  0.10 -1.60
